    {
      "id": "c426458f-b3f3-4d9c-9858-d3a2c2e39209",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2320,
        6720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 816,
        "content": "## Track Amazon prices from Google Sheets and send Telegram alerts on drops\n\n### Who's it for\n\nDeal hunters and small buyers who watch a wish list of products and want one low-cost alerting setup instead of paying tier-based fees to services like Honey, CamelCamelCamel, or Visualping.\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs on a schedule to monitor an Amazon wish list stored in Google Sheets. It reads the list, uses Apify to scrape current Amazon prices, then checks whether any item has dropped below its target price. It updates the last seen price in Google Sheets and sends a Telegram alert when a qualifying price drop is found.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Schedule Trigger with the desired monitoring frequency.\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials and select the spreadsheet/range containing the wish list, target prices, and last seen price fields.\n- Configure the Apify credentials and actor/input needed to scrape Amazon product prices from the sheet data.\n- Connect Telegram bot credentials and set the target chat/channel for price drop notifications.\n- Verify the IF condition compares the scraped price against the correct target price field.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the schedule, Google Sheets column mappings, target-price logic, Apify scraper settings, and Telegram message format to match the wish list structure and alert preferences.\n\nSwap the Amazon Product Scraper for a different Apify Actor, such as Google Flights, Zillow, or Booking.com, to track prices on other sites. Replace the Telegram node with Slack, Email, or Discord for a different alert channel."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "f68781a7-06bb-4c36-a965-b73dd0065814",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2880,
        6848
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Load and scrape wishlist\n\nStarts the workflow on a schedule, reads the tracked products from Google Sheets, and sends them to Apify to retrieve current Amazon prices."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
